Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Bind RenderingDevice.driver_callback_add for native SDK
 dispatch

Expose the render-graph driver callback (the MetalFX mechanism) to scripts and
GDExtensions: a Callable receives the native command buffer, plus the
DRIVER_RESOURCE_COMMAND_BUFFER handle (Vulkan only for now).
